(text "PERFBOARD CABLE HEADERS" (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0091e3cc-551b-4aca-b963-30ea6dfd671f"))
(text "Pin numbers match the layout and Harness.csv. All headers are 2.54 mm pitch; every drawn contact is on the perfboard." (at 15.24 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4ebb84cf-dbaf-40c6-b46e-79ef2e66baa4"))
(text "J101/J102: paired even pins are GND.\nJ101 pin 15 receives Nucleo 3.3 V.\nJ103: regulated 5 V from buck only.\n24 V and motor currents stay off this board." (at 139.7 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e0fc18bb-d90b-442c-b8e5-00e1907312cb"))
(text "J104: 1 PUL+, 2 PUL-, 3 DIR+, 4 DIR-, 5 ENA+, 6 ENA-.\nJ105/J106: 1 VDD, 2 GND, 3 DIR, 4 STEP, 5 MS1, 6 MS2,\n7 DIAG (NC), 8 INDEX (NC), 9 UART (NC), 10 EN.\nJ107 follows the numbered J2 encoder connector." (at 139.7 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9ce57e7c-e922-49e5-973f-929c22562310"))
(text "Read Harness.csv for destination contacts (CNxx.pin / driver labels).\nExternal module symbols elsewhere show the far end of these cables. Matching names represent the same conductor.\nJ108-J111 (Nucleo reference inputs and the three NC switches): see the Reference limit switches sheet." (at 20.32 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d1710f3-3050-41a9-be7c-5506364734fe"))
)
